	(text "CL = 10 pF; initial caps 10 pF each. Short, symmetric traces.\nC0 <= 3 pF, ESR <= 70 ohm; calculated gmcrit ~0.48 mA/V.\nConfirm startup, <=100 uW drive and frequency on PCB.\nCrystal operating range: -10 to +60 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.892 34.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "32268d63-1474-4951-bb45-9a055c86a707")
	)
	(text "MCU supply bypassing / reset / boot"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.526 148.336 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "78fb8c2f-12ce-42dc-9f44-a6df5371ff55")
	)
	(text "MCU DESIGN NOTES\nSTDC14 + external ST-Link, 64 MiB flash, 16 MHz HSE; current sensing deferred.\nVDDA / VREF+ caps are downstream of 0603 beads. Disable VREFBUF.\nC11: 47u nominal / 10 V / 20% / X5R / 1206; not power-loss hold-up.\nFlash boot: configure nSWBOOT0/nBOOT0; retain NRST on PG10.\nDisable UCPD dead-battery behavior before PB6 status LED operation.\nPC0..3: protected pyro ADCs; PB1: protected VIN_LOGIC ADC via U7 CH4.\nSENSE_EN defaults low via R44. Wait >=5 ms after enabling, use long sample time.\nPB5 AF2: ~4 kHz buzzer PWM; R56 discharges the piezo, R55 holds driver off.\nGPIO high lights existing D1 via R5 on power_setup. PA9/10 and PB4 are spare.\nValidate oscillator startup/drive, ADC settling, recording throughput and PCB layout.\nTODO text is retained as requested; firmware and bench verification remain."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 207.772 194.818 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7bba39c5-cfc1-4109-b4b9-a932f786c5cd")
	)
	(text "Standard SPI; use 4-byte commands/addressing beyond 16 MiB. WP/HOLD pulled high.\nPre-erase before flight; never erase during recording. Buffer data and program 256-byte pages.\n48 bytes x 1000 records/s x 900 s = 43.2 MB. CRC + sequence numbers; verify worst-case throughput.\nNRST resets flash too: reset or power loss during programming can corrupt the in-progress page."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.088 153.924 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "839afa83-d66a-449a-a575-9b577da80ba7")
	)
	(text "External ST-Link / STDC14"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 16.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8e80c663-c1d3-43e3-beee-acdad4b4fb37")
	)
	(text "TODO: \nLook into NRST and BOOT0 configuration\nLook into STLink setup"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.026 186.944 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b7e93550-6083-4a8c-aa0a-3ac0d96fba3f")
	)
	(text "Microcontroller and assigned interfaces"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.272 17.526 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c780dda9-56d7-4f0a-ba48-965460b5a705")
	)
	(text "VTref is a sense input; power target separately.\nSWD + SWO + USART2 console; no on-board probe.\nPin 13: probe TX -> MCU RX; pin 14: MCU TX -> probe RX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.69 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c90af994-dae9-48da-bc6d-be26af23cb7e")
	)
	(text "There is some important layout here!\nFigure out what the right topology is!"
